GNIRS CC Release Notes. The release numbers below are used to
track tags in CVS. So update your release specific notes here 
and add a cvs tag accordingly.
*************************************************************
*V1-19:
 - Added LR and HR IFU and filter wheel changes
*V1-16:
 - Remove debug print statements for REL-3467.
*V1-15:
 - Revert back to using fw1
*V1-14:
 - Use fw2 instead of fw1 for squiggle avoidance (implmented in
   V1-10) as fw1 was wearing out. Added LOLO, LOW values to
   startupCC.pv.
*V1-13:
 - Added debug code to mech.c that unfortunatly fixed the
   problem (at least it ran for four months without reproducing).
   Leaving debug code in as it's only triggered when the fault
   reproduces.
*V1-12:
 - Version number skipped for some reason ..
*V1-11:
 - Change datum algorithm for rotary devices in motors.c.
 - Fix bug in nodeLookup that results in matches that shouldn't
   be.

*V1-10:
 - Add feature to move filter wheels in order to block stray
   light that causes squiggles on the detector.

*V1-9:
 - Add focus values for FW1.

*V1-8:
- Filter Wheel 2 is now set to always use the alternate HOME switch.

- Modifies all mechanism names such that the menu selection specicifies
  only human readable names: this is what the seqexec will use
  to configure GNIRS.

- Further, the GNIRS instrument part ID's will be appendend to
  the names in the status field. These concatenated strings
  will be included to in the FITS header.

- WCS file is now automated depending on Camera, aoFold, and ISSport.

- Add WCS utilities showwcsxform() and showwcsheader()

- NIS Focus LUT Proceesing changed mechanism names to remove part ID.

*V1-7:
- Modifies the names of the prisms to depend on camera selection.
- Updates the focus LUTs accoringly to deal with prism name changes.

*V1-3:
This is the first GNIRS Summit Release for Gemini North.
